  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUNNY: SUSTAINABLE ENERGY SYSTEMS FOR REFUGEE AND HOST COMMUNITIES IN AFRICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUNNY will tailor high-TRL (TRL 5-6) innovative, energy-efficient off-grid energy solutions that improve climate adaptation and mitigation potential in the African social, economic, and environmental context (PR1). The energy solutions include solutions for off-grid communities, such as electricity and clean cooking solutions for i) household, ii) enterprise/productive use, and iii) community level.</narrative>
  </description>
